+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that passwords are hashed with argon2id, a memory-hard password hashing function chosen for its resistance to GPU-based cracking attacks through tunable time and memory costs. No specific cost parameters (memory, iterations, parallelism) have been recorded, so none are stated here.
